# Vanishing Act's 507 clears the questItem var (task 7 mutants): a Sickle at Prog 2: 507, finished: the Rainbow
# Berry, questItem 0. The berry taken and Prog 1 (GMs): the Harvesting Point's own 507 (the quest's trade answers
# nil), finished: no berry again (questItem is 0, not left at 1).
lists WajaomWoodlands/Harvesting_Point/onTrade WajaomWoodlands/onEventFinish/507
char zone=WajaomWoodlands pos=-587.328,-17.999,-200 job=WAR lvl=75
item Sickle x2
quest AhtUrhgan.DeliveringTheGoods completed
quest AhtUrhgan.VanishingAct accepted
charvar Quest[6][62]Prog 2
login
trade Harvesting_Point Sickle x1        # Prog 2, no berry: questItem 1; 507
finish                                  # the Rainbow Berry; questItem 0
delkeyitem RainbowBerry                 # a GM
charvar Quest[6][62]Prog 1              # a GM
trade Harvesting_Point Sickle x1        # Prog 1: nil (the Harvesting Point's own 507)
delkeyitem RainbowBerry                 # a GM, between the trade and the finish
finish                                  # questItem 0: no berry given again (a stale 1 would give it)
